0..74 Comment "// What a thunk captures that stays, and the three axes of its image, each"
75..106 Comment "// refused by its capture rule."
107..109 Comment "//"
110..187 Comment "// A thunk crosses with its environment, so a capture that cannot cross keeps"
188..266 Comment "// the thunk at its world. Where a capture lives, how often it is held and the"
267..321 Comment "// world it stands at are decided before any crossing."
322..324 Comment "//"
325..399 Comment "// Each declaration forms a thunk at the seat for the operator. A crossing"
400..470 Comment "// names what the thunk reads: `Capture` for a hypothesis it captures,"
471..544 Comment "// `Homed` for a declaration homed at the seat. A thunk reached through a"
545..593 Comment "// variable carries no image, so it stays whole."
594..596 Comment "//"
597..671 Comment "// - see: `model/worlds/closure-axes.gandr` — what a thunk captures that"
672..684 Comment "//   crosses"
685..758 Comment "// - see: `pathological/regions/stashed.gandr` — a thunk keeping what a"
759..776 Comment "//   region lends"
778..852 Comment "// The operator\'s and the seat\'s worlds, and the seat\'s sealed side of the"
853..888 Comment "// exchange, its dispatch unmarked."
